{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-4cbf5d483948", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:38:01.740Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:38:08.364Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13372, "tokens_out": 101, "latency": 6.5997, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does our reserving guidance say about setting an initial reserve on a new claim?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:35c2f9ad3629a832d68ffc1f7ce464ce9630699fd7862ccbfeb01bf1c01bb4d7", "response_text": "I'll search our reserving guidance for information about initial reserves on new claims.", "response_hash": "sha256:9648979b478b7892446db093a43329afa895635b09bfb033456f20e7e82c6ced", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-4cbf5d483948", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:38:01.740Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:38:08.625Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14536, "tokens_out": 220, "latency": 0.2603, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does our reserving guidance say about setting an initial reserve on a new claim?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:35c2f9ad3629a832d68ffc1f7ce464ce9630699fd7862ccbfeb01bf1c01bb4d7", "response_text": "According to our reserving guidance (prc-reserving-001), here's what you need to do when setting an initial reserve on a new claim:\n\n**Timing:** Set an opening reserve within one working day of the claim being notified.\n\n**Where information is limited:** Use the class average from the table rather than leaving the reserve at nil. A nil reserve on an open claim is treated as a reporting error, not a neutral position.\n\n**Class averages for opening reserves:**\n- Motor, own damage: £2,400\n- Motor, third party property: £3,100\n- Motor, third party injury: £12,000\n- Household, escape of water: £4,800\n- Household, subsidence: £18,000\n- Commercial property: £9,500\n- Professional indemnity: £25,000\n\nThe key point is that you must always set a reserve when you open a claim—leaving it blank is not an option and will be flagged as a reporting error.", "response_hash": "sha256:28428c3c81623a82e36d3f1963fbb509f361f85dbb66dc4d79838a84db54c8d5", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
